  "verse_id": "tsa-a03-v08",
  "song": "tsa-a03",
  "verse": 8,
  "quick_english": "How is that causeless? Then the reason-question: why? By the logic of mirror-speech — and the reason will be the Supreme Lord's power, synonym of autonomy; from world-reflection-bearing comes the Lord's world-selfhood, for consciousness-made is the world, the place of consciousness-manifestation; this world here is obstruction — reflection-bearing; but that world-selfhood is the Lord's own nature, not un-contradicted, since self-nature-contemplation of consciousness-nature is impossible.",
